                                        <div class="ielts-reading-questions">
                                                                                                                                                                                            <div class="ielts-standalone-q" data-qnum="32"><div class="ielts-q-header"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">32</strong><span class="ielts-q-title"><span>Charles chose Pepys for the task because he considered him to be trustworthy.</span></div><div class="ielts-radio-group"><label class="ielts-radio-btn"><input type="radio" data-qnum="32" name="question_32" value="YES"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>YES</strong> </span></label><label class="ielts-radio-btn"><input type="radio" data-qnum="32" name="question_32" value="NO"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>NO</strong> </span></label><label class="ielts-radio-btn"><input type="radio" data-qnum="32" name="question_32" value="NOT GIVEN"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>NOT GIVEN</strong> </span></label></div></div><div class="ielts-standalone-q" data-qnum="33"><div class="ielts-q-header"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">33</strong><span class="ielts-q-title"><span>Charles’s personal recollection of the escape lacked sufficient detail.</span></div><div class="ielts-radio-group"><label class="ielts-radio-btn"><input type="radio" data-qnum="33" name="question_33" value="YES"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>YES</strong> </span></label><label class="ielts-radio-btn"><input type="radio" data-qnum="33" name="question_33" value="NO"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>NO</strong> </span></label><label class="ielts-radio-btn"><input type="radio" data-qnum="33" name="question_33" value="NOT GIVEN"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>NOT GIVEN</strong> </span></label></div></div><div class="ielts-standalone-q" data-qnum="34"><div class="ielts-q-header"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">34</strong><span class="ielts-q-title"><span>Charles indicated to Pepys that he had planned his escape before the battle.</span></div><div class="ielts-radio-group"><label class="ielts-radio-btn"><input type="radio" data-qnum="34" name="question_34" value="YES"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>YES</strong> </span></label><label class="ielts-radio-btn"><input type="radio" data-qnum="34" name="question_34" value="NO"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>NO</strong> </span></label><label class="ielts-radio-btn"><input type="radio" data-qnum="34" name="question_34" value="NOT GIVEN"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>NOT GIVEN</strong> </span></label></div></div><div class="ielts-standalone-q" data-qnum="35"><div class="ielts-q-header"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">35</strong><span class="ielts-q-title"><span>The inclusion of Charles’s account is a positive aspect of the book.</span></div><div class="ielts-radio-group"><label class="ielts-radio-btn"><input type="radio" data-qnum="35" name="question_35" value="YES"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>YES</strong> </span></label><label class="ielts-radio-btn"><input type="radio" data-qnum="35" name="question_35" value="NO"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>NO</strong> </span></label><label class="ielts-radio-btn"><input type="radio" data-qnum="35" name="question_35" value="NOT GIVEN"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>NOT GIVEN</strong> </span></label></div></div></div>
