                                                                                                                                                            <h2 class="ielts-reading-question-section-heading">
                                            Questions 19-23                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                    </h2>
                                        <div class="ielts-reading-question-section-content">
                                            <p><em>Look at the following statements and the list of researchers below.</em></p>
<p><em>Match each statement with the correct researcher, <strong>A-D</strong>.</em></p>
<p><em>Write the correct letter, <strong>A-D</strong>, in boxes on your answer sheet.</em></p>
<p><strong><em>NB</em></strong><em>   You may use any letter more than once.</em></p>
<p><strong>A   </strong>  Jorg Kudla</p>
<p><strong>B   </strong>  Caixia Gao</p>
<p><strong>C   </strong>  Joyce Van Eck</p>
<p><strong>D  </strong>   Jonathan Jones</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="ielts-reading-questions">
